# 699c14f189ea4781b54ab828faa579e7
#: ../plugins/index.rst:46
msgid "Plugins management interface"
msgstr "Interfaccia di gestione Plugin"

# f0d2b7511fad4536af2cd3f8b589e9f7
#: ../plugins/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"A plugins management interface is provided, you will find it from the "
"dashboard or in the configuration menu. After you have downloaded plugin(s) "
"in Galette ``plugins`` directory, a list will be displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Viene fornita un'interfaccia di gestione dei plugin, la troverete dal "
"cruscotto o nel menu di configurazione. Dopo aver scaricato i plugin nella "
"cartella ``plugins`` di Galette, verrà visualizzato un elenco:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:50
msgid "Plugins management"
msgstr "Gestione dei plugin"

# 3701d8b0588649ff914801cc8acd029a
#: ../plugins/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"If web server has read access to your plugins directory, then you can enable "
"or disable any plugin from the related icon."
msgstr ""
"Se il server web ha accesso in lettura alla cartella dei plugin, allora è "
"possibile abilitare o disabilitare qualsiasi plugin dall'icona relativa."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"If plugin requires a database to work, you can play installation and update "
"scripts from the interface."
msgstr ""
"Se il plugin richiede un database per lavorare, è possibile eseguire gli "
"script di installazione e aggiornamento dall'interfaccia."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:59
msgid ""
"Database ACLs will then be checked. Unlike Galette, no information will be "
"asked to you, since all is already available from your current instance."
msgstr ""
"Il database ACL verrà poi controllato. A differenza di Galette, non vi "
"saranno richieste informazioni, poiché tutto è già disponibile dall'istanza "
"corrente."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"Each plugin now has its own database version, and is updated on its own. The "
"page lists the active plugins first, then the inactive ones, with the reason "
"why they are inactive."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"An icon next to the name of an inactive plugin tells why it is not active:"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Not installed**: the plugin needs database tables that have not been "
"created yet. Click on the database icon of the **Actions** column to install "
"them,"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Need update**: the plugin files are more recent than its database. Click "
"on the database icon to run the update,"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Explicitly disabled**: the plugin has been disabled from this page, or "
"from the :doc:`command line </command-line>`. Click on the activation icon "
"to enable it again,"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Incompatible with current version**: the plugin is made for another "
"version of Galette; look for a more recent version of the plugin,"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"**A required file is missing**: the plugin files are incomplete; download "
"the plugin again,"
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Database version missing**: Galette cannot tell which version of the "
"plugin database is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:74
msgid ""
"The name of an active plugin opens a window with information about it: "
"version, author, routes and access rights."
msgstr ""

#: ../plugins/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"Back up your database before installing or updating a plugin database, as "
"you would before updating Galette itself."
msgstr ""

